        "Content": "For Sale by Private Treaty\r\nMain Street\r\nClogheen    \r\nCo. Tipperary   \r\nE21 CY29\r\n\r\n\r\n6-Bedroom House. In excess of 2100sqft\r\nGuide: €95,000\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to present new to the market, this immaculately vast 6bedroom derelict property. Extensive works are required but this property offers massive potential in its current form or conversion. A superb location only a short walk from the amenities on the foothills of the Knockmealdown Mountains. A short commute from Cork, Limerick & Clonmel. Viewing strictly by appointment. \r\n\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nLocated on the historic main street, 2 minutes walk from a wealth of amenities, This property is just 15mins from Junction 12 of the M8 Motorway & comparable distance from both Cork & Waterford cities. Within an area of outstanding natural beauty & known tourism.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nSpacious property in excess of 2100sqft. \r\nPotential for conversion to 3 apartments (subject to pp).\r\nMains water & sewerage. Garden to rear.\r\nHigh 9ft ceilings, many original features.\r\nSome sash windows & shutters, cornicing/mouldings.\r\nElectricity supply still active, modern fuse board.\r\nBelieved qualify for derelict grants up to €70,000.\r\nOn the 245/007 bus routes, Cork-Clonmel-Kilkenny.\r\nJust over 45 minutes from the Jack Lynch Tunnel.\r\n60 minutes from Waterford, 1hr 45 from Citywest.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation: (Ground floor)\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway:\r\n2.45m x 1.49m \r\n8.03ft x 4.90ft\r\n\r\nInner Hallway:\r\n4.53m x 1.50m \r\n14.86ft x 4.92ft\r\n\r\nDining room:\r\n3.38m x 2.85m \r\n11.10ft x 9.35ft\r\n\r\n\r\nCellar:\r\n2.94m x 1.30m \r\n9.65ft x 4.25ft\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving room:\r\n5.57m x 4.77m \r\n18.27ft x 15.07ft\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\n4.66m x 3.55m \r\n15.29ft x 11.63ft\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nBedroom 1: \r\n4.72m x 4.65m \r\n15.48ft x 15.24ft\r\n\r\nPotential ensuite : \r\nSmall room located between bed 1 and 2,                       both rooms have access.\r\n4.72m x 2.43m \r\n15.54ft x 7.97ft\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \r\n4.58m x 3.41m \r\n15.01ft x 11.18ft\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \r\n4.17m x 3.60m \r\n13.67ft x 11.81ft\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nInaccessible \r\n\r\nLanding:\r\n2.09m x 2.03m \r\n6.67ft x 6.10ft\r\n\r\n\r\nSecond floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: \r\n4.59m x 3.40m \r\n15.05ft x 11.18ft\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 5: \r\n3.36m x 2.68m \r\n11.02ft x 8.78ft\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 6: \r\n4.71m x 4.71m \r\n15.44ft x 15.44ft\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding:\r\n2.44m x 1.17m \r\n8.01ft x 3.83ft\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms:\r\nGuide: €95,000\r\nThis property is being offered for Sale by private treaty. Terms are available and to   be negotiated on application with agents:\r\n\r\nMichael Dorgan Auctioneers & Valuers\r\nBaldwin Street\r\nMitchelstown\r\nCo. Cork\r\n\r\n(025) 85700\r\nEmail: Info@michaeldorgan  .i  e\r\n\r\nViewing: Strictly by Appointment only.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe above particulars are issued by Michael Dorgan, Auctioneers & Valuers on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars but the company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. Potential purchasers must clarify all information contained within marketing documents with their own engineers/surveyors and solicitors. Failure to do so cannot be considered the agents liability.\r\n\r\n All reasonable offers will be submitted to vendors. These particulars do not form any contract for Sale or lease subsequently entered into.\r\nInformation gathered from public sources may be subject to copy write, we are happy to acknowledge same if it becomes known to us.\r\n\r\nAny form of this brochure may not be reused"
